WEBVTT

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.420
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.120
You want me to put you in the 
same school your brother funds?

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.830
You're not better yet, though...

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:04.800
Dad.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.110
I've had a change of heart since Mom died.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:11.200
I can experience going to school again, too.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.270
Don't worry.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.290
My brother will look after me.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.010
I'll come back after a year.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:51.560
Final Episode
Evil or Live

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.030
Mom, be careful around Brother.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.990
I'll be fine.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.000
You shouldn't be distrustful of family.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.800
Hey, Shin.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.660
It's a real shame, isn't it?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.610
The son of a mistress?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.510
He's the one?

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:24.810
Mistresses suck!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.350
Yeah!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.400
I hear his mother's a mistress!

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.080
They say the children of 
mistresses are unclean.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.020
He must be diseased!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.280
Get lost!

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:34.690
Stop it.

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.940
Hey, Shin.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.380
Come over here.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.340
Don't blame your father.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.500
He does a lot for us, doesn't he?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.520
<i>This place...</i>

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.400
<i>It really is awful, isn't it?</i>

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:01.420
<i>A year has passed in the blink of an eye.</i>

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.520
<i>Brother.</i>

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.120
<i>A wonderful present from me to you.</i>

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.120
<i>Please accept it!</i>

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.900
Line up! Number off!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.320
One!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:28.630
Two!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:28.960
Three!

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:29.340
Four!

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:29.660
Five!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:29.990
Six!

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:30.290
Seven!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:30.720
Eight!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.210
Nine!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.350
Eh?

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.740
Where's Hoku, your class leader?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:34.720
Sir.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:38.100
Hoku and Akane have had a stomachache 
and a fever since yesterday,

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:40.010
so they're staying in bed today.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:42.700
Oh?

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.970
You're missing one.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.070
I wish to report.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.200
Moku has low stamina,

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.010
and he overworked himself 
in yesterday's training,

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.230
so he's staying in the 
dorm with a fever today.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.020
Please excuse his absence.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.290
He's useless.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.400
Hibiki, come here.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.030
I have an announcement.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.700
A committee has appointed Hibiki the new 
student council president and discipline officer.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.450
I want you all to follow 
Hibiki's example and work hard.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:16.000
Then you'll all be able to return 
and be useful to society soon.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.500
Hibiki.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.500
Are you happy to be on top?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.400
I have a mission for you already.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.940
If you can see it through,

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.510
you'll get a big reward.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:30.510
You know about Shin, right?

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.660
Of course I do.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.880
I see.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.220
He's the son of a friend of mine,

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:38.600
but he's gone missing.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.030
The instructors are searching for him.

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.700
Please see that the students 
join in the search.

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.520
The more eyes, the better.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.740
Instructor Ryo told me you had 
a fight with Shin in the past.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.510
If you find him,

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.990
your reward will be to do 
with him whatever you like.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.990
What do you think?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.010
Thank you very much, Big Bro Hyo.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:03.010
I've been hoping to really 
settle things between us.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.780
Big Bro.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.980
Hibiki's a crafty one.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.520
Are you sure you can afford 
to trust him so much?

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:20.160
A student made fun of by the school 
climbed his own way to the top.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:25.530
He won't pass up a chance 
for more power.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.380
And if he won't take up the mission,

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.490
we'll just deal with him like we did Jun.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.250
Trash abandoned by their parents like this...

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.500
No one will care how we deal with them.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.970
That's true.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.130
Jun was a real troublemaker.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.420
She was involved with the 
police before, right?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.630
And you were hiding her here, right?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.280
Then she lost your precious cell phone.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.280
It's only natural she'd be punished.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.010
Nothing to be said about it now.

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:11.460
She was just too young to 
properly fulfill her mission.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.490
Y-Yes. You're correct, of course.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:18.310
If even the instructors can't find Shin,

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:19.940
do you really think Hibiki can?

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.630
I don't care if he can or not.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.200
He doesn't have long to live either way.

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.240
The goods will be arriving soon.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.110
Let's go.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.910
Go ahead, try to act tough!

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.020
Stop it.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.800
Big Bro Hibiki...

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.500
Hey, Jan.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.500
The way you're acting is no 
different from Yoh and Wudo.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.500
Sorry, Big Bro.

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:25.020
Everyone,

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.520
I'm sorry about the terrible things 
I've done to you in the past.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:32.260
I have an important favor to ask of you.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.990
I won't force you, of course.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:36.760
B-Big Bro.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.000
What are you saying?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.490
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.640
Y-Yeah, Big Bro.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.860
I apologize for what I've done in the past.

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:48.000
I promise we'll all do whatever you say.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.500
Yeah, Big Bro!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.730
We're with you!

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.210
We're with you, Big Bro!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:03.600
This will be your last 
training session at this school.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.230
This is...

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:22.510
Hey, Editor!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.200
Yes?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.730
Neppa News, editorial office.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:30.800
To whom am I speaking?

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.600
What did you say?!

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.320
Treatment for Internet addiction?

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.270
Look.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.770
Did you know schools like this existed?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.610
Did you see?

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:41.310
It's all over the message boards.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.140
At a reform school for Internet addiction,

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.370
students are being abused.

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.870
They're even breaking the law.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.020
Those poor students.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.640
It sounds terrible.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.330
Big Bro Hyo.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:13.500
Welcome back.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:16.260
Today's a special delivery,

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.760
so I'll check it personally.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:18.810
Yes, sir!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:24.380
Looks like we'll get to go home early today.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:27.410
Yeah, maybe we'll even get to 
go home for the weekend.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.450
Excuse me.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:31.020
Could I have a word?

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.530
Stop!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.200
Big Bro?

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.180
<i>No...</i>

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.490
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.000
Hyo, never come back here again.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:11.030
Who the hell did this?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.090
Big Bro... what's going on?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.530
Was it you?

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.800
Hibiki, then?

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.130
No, it couldn't be...

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:26.200
Shin?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.530
Hey!

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.960
Shut off all power to the school!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:32.540
But...

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:33.500
Hurry!

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:35.280
Listen, you.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:35.950
Y-Yes, sir!

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:36.900
Seal off this area!

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.300
Then get all the students 
onto the athletic field

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.800
and start the standard training!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.690
Yes, sir!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:48.680
Problems at many Internet addiction rehabilitation schools?

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.760
If I'd know this was going to happen,

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.810
I would have used Jun...

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:52.600
She could have controlled 
information on the Internet.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.000
But it doesn't matter now.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.020
Once I get out of here, I can still take action.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.410
Please explain!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.630
Is the news on the Internet true?

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:02.030
Let us talk to the headmistress!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.080
Why are you cutting off cell phone reception?

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.210
Do the guardians know what 
happens at this school?

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.740
Are the stories about corporal 
punishment by the instructors true?

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.050
And it seems you're smuggling drugs, too.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:13.500
We have evidence from videos, 
pictures, and chat records!

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.000
Do calm down.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:22.000
I am the headmistress, Jean.

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:25.700
I will gladly answer your questions.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.110
Well? Is it all done?

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.540
Of course! This was no problem for me.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.360
The Internet's in an uproar and 
reporters are flocking to the school.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.000
Hibiki.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.030
We did everything we had to do.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:42.120
Next, it's your turn.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.450
I was in the middle of a game.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.000
They shut off the damn power?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.400
Hey, you guys! Get out here!

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.300
Assemble on the grounds! Hurry!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.500
Hurry it up! Can't you hear us?

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.120
Big Bro Hyo.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.690
Where are you going in such a rush?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.440
How did you know I was here?

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.440
I was just passing by.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.380
I have a little business to take care of.

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.420
You help Instructor Ryo.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.270
We'll talk later.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:35.400
Have you checked Jun's cell phone?

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:39.620
There's a bit of a scene 
happening at the school gate.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:43.440
Is it possible the data on that 
phone was leaked to the outside?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.890
I'm going to deal with that now.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.800
You find Instructor Ryo.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.890
I found Shin.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.800
Instructor Ryo has been protecting him.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.340
A guy named Ban is with him, too.

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:00.290
There's nothing more I can do.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.940
Big Bro, would you like to 
confirm it with your own eyes?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.940
Hey, Hibiki.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.940
You little brat...

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:11.130
<i>I need to stall him.</i>

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:13.450
<i>I'm gonna make the commotion even bigger.</i>

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.500
<i>What the hell? He's too fast!</i>

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.430
You've really done it now.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.610
Hey, before you die, 
you'd better tell me everything.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.440
What the hell did you do?

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.300
Big Bro Hyo, I did pretty well, didn't I?

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:02.160
I won't let you escape.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:06.090
You brat...

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.460
That's enough!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.410
Shian...

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.090
Hey, Hyo. Give up already.

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.430
The reporters are after us.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:22.000
The police will be here soon.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:25.700
We should give ourselves up peaceably.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.200
Reporters?

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.600
Police?

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:32.600
Give ourselves up?

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.210
What will they see here?

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:46.460
It's just strict instructors working 
earnestly to make their students better!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:50.970
We cut off cell phone reception so 
the students would focus on their training.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.050
The instructors are cut off from 
the Internet just like the students are.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.880
That's fair, isn't it?

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:58.430
Where is there a reform 
school as good as this?

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.610
Students getting injured from beatings?

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:01.930
Gross food in the mess hall?

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:05.940
It's enduring such suffering 
that makes people better.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.940
Those who can't understand that are fools!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.380
And what about you two?

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.320
One works with the headmistress

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.100
to threaten instructors and 
physically punish students!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:20.500
The other has banded students together to 
riot and disrupt the order of the school!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.450
It's you two who will be arrested!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:27.960
Which side do you think the 
reporters and police will believe?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.430
Where are the students?

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.720
Where the hell did they go?

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:45.890
Hey, Hyo.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.450
Did you honestly think you 
could control them forever?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.300
No problem.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:58.450
There are plenty of ways to ride this out.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:16:59.990
Shian.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:03.950
Do you really believe the police will come?

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:07.380
That's nothing but an Internet rumor.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.950
There's no way the police will come for us.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.700
I've been waiting for this moment...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.640
for so long.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.070
It's burning.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.890
Isn't that... Shin's room?

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:37.920
Why?

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.020
It's a fire!

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.960
Call the fire department! Hurry!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.630
There's no signal!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.920
Someone call the police right now!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:54.300
How did this happen?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.930
It seems things won't go 
the way you wanted them.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.940
Damn you...

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:09.440
You won't escape as long as I stand.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.940
Hibiki, hurry up.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.210
You still have more to do, don't you?

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:22.040
Thank you very much, Head Instructor Shian.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:24.020
I'm grateful for your teachings.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.150
Hyo. I've sinned, too.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.100
Let's end this together.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.470
You bastard!

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:02.450
Take Care of Yourself! Escape Internet Addiction!
